A copy of lib/rbcodec/codecs/libmad (GPL-2.0-or-later, see COPYING), built
into the GabagoolOS interface to decode internet radio. Two changes from the
Rockbox copy: global.h no longer includes codeclib.h (the codec plugin
interface, which reroutes malloc and memcpy), and the fixed-point code is
chosen by compiler (__mips__ on the player, 64-bit C on the test build).
synth.c's synth_full() is marked no_sanitize("array-bounds") for clang: its
backward table offset is deliberate (Rockbox's codec runs the same code).
